+## Changed
+
+Added `read_task_history`, `TaskHistory`, `PreSpawnHistory`, `StartCount`,
+`RetryGroup` and `ScopeHistory` under `src/read/task_history/`, folding a task
+stream's parsed lines into the attempts, unexplained re-runs, dead reasons,
+verify codes, pre-spawn counts, costs, retry groups, stuck events and scope
+counts that TypeScript's report observers produce. Added
+`read_rejection_planner` under `src/read/rejection.rs`, sharing the same loose
+line parser and reading the brief's planner through `frontmatter_string`.
+Exported every public item from the read module and the crate root.
+
+Added `tests/reading_task_history.rs` covering every "Task histories" row plus
+a fast test for the unequal detection exit-code split, and
+`tests/reading_rejection_planner.rs` covering every "Rejection planners" row.
+
+Touched: crates/kernel/storage/src/lib.rs, crates/kernel/storage/src/read/mod.rs, crates/kernel/storage/src/read/task_history/mod.rs, crates/kernel/storage/src/read/task_history/attempts.rs, crates/kernel/storage/src/read/task_history/costs.rs, crates/kernel/storage/src/read/task_history/dead_reasons.rs, crates/kernel/storage/src/read/task_history/pre_spawn.rs, crates/kernel/storage/src/read/task_history/retries.rs, crates/kernel/storage/src/read/task_history/scope.rs, crates/kernel/storage/src/read/task_history/stream.rs, crates/kernel/storage/src/read/task_history/verify_codes.rs, crates/kernel/storage/src/read/rejection.rs, crates/kernel/storage/tests/reading_task_history.rs, crates/kernel/storage/tests/reading_rejection_planner.rs
